  "prefLabel": "Per 602.02 Part-time, Temporary, and Seasonal Employees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 602.02 Part-time, Temporary, and Seasonal Employees. Part-time, temporary, and seasonal employees who have not been converted to permanent employees in accordance with RSA 98-A:2 and Per 601 shall be considered at-will employees not subject to a probationary period or to the procedures for discipline and termination in Per 1000 unless expressly specified in this chapter.\n\nSource. #14433, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per100-1500.html"
